    <briefdescription>
<para>Coordinator for distributed storage transactions (v1.7.0). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages shard registration and drives Two-Phase Commit (2PC) across registered <ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_i_distributed_shard_participant" kindref="compound">IDistributedShardParticipant</ref> instances.</para>
<para>This class is thread-safe; individual <ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_distributed_transaction" kindref="compound">DistributedTransaction</ref> handles are single-threaded.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Participants are stored as raw pointers (wrapped internally with a no-op deleter shared_ptr). Callers must ensure that any registered participant object is not destroyed before it is either unregistered or the manager itself is destroyed. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
